                    <a href="https://example.com/kessel/read" style="color:#f3e9d2;font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Read the reduced issue</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
